---
title: "lead_senior_fixed_pay (Sherlock Watsons)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_rank: determine senior watson percentile
    q_get_rank --> q_calc_percentile: percentile = rank / total_seniors
    q_calc_percentile --> q_tier1: percentile <= 0.33
    q_calc_percentile --> q_tier2: 0.33 < percentile <= 0.67
    q_calc_percentile --> q_tier3: percentile > 0.67
    q_tier1 --> q_scale_pay: base_pay = 12500 USDC per week
    q_tier2 --> q_scale_pay: base_pay = 10000 USDC per week
    q_tier3 --> q_scale_pay: base_pay = 7500 USDC per week
    q_scale_pay --> q_total_pay: fixed_pay = base_pay * contest_weeks
    q_total_pay --> q_split: 75% paid after judging, 25% after fix review
    q_split --> [*]: return fixed_pay_schedule

    note right of q_calc_percentile
        INV-001: Percentile = watson_rank / total_senior_watsons
        INV-002: Top 33% earns 12500, top 67% earns 10000, rest earns 7500 per week
    end note

    note right of q_split
        INV-003: 75% of fixed pay released within 2 weeks of audit end
        INV-004: 25% released up to 2 weeks after fix review
        INV-005: 25% may be forfeited if watson places outside top 10 in contest
    end note
